content.content:
# Alertmanager Template Contents

Based on the GitHub page content, here's the alertmanager.yml template file:

**Title Template:**
```
{{- if eq .status "firing" }}
🚨 Alert: {{ (first .alerts).labels.alertname }}
{{- else if eq .status "resolved" }}
✅ Resolved: {{ (first .alerts).labels.alertname }}
{{- else }}
{{ fail "Unsupported Alertmanager status." }}
{{- end }}
```

**Message Template:**
```
Status: {{ .status | title }}
Receiver: {{ .receiver }}

{{- range .alerts }}
Alert: {{ .labels.alertname }}
Instance: {{ .labels.instance }}
Severity: {{ .labels.severity }}
Starts at: {{ .startsAt }}
{{- if .endsAt }}Ends at: {{ .endsAt }}{{ end }}
{{- if .annotations.summary }}
Summary: {{ .annotations.summary }}
{{- end }}
{{- if .annotations.description }}
Description: {{ .annotations.description }}
{{- end }}
Source: {{ .generatorURL }}

{{ end }}
```

This template formats Alertmanager notifications for the ntfy service, using emoji indicators for firing vs. resolved alerts and conditionally displaying optional annotation fields.

