content.text:
Based on the ntfy documentation and the built-in alertmanager template, let me create a test message that matches what Alertmanager actually sends. The key is that ntfy's built-in `alertmanager` template expects the standard Alertmanager webhook format.

Here's a properly formatted test message:

```bash
curl -X POST "http://10.100.5.100:8080/homelab-alerts?template=alertmanager&priority=default&tags=warning,homelab" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
  "receiver": "ntfy",
  "status": "firing",
  "alerts": [
    {
      "status": "firing",
      "labels": {
        "alertname": "TestAlert",
        "severity": "warning",
        "instance": "test-server:9100"
      },
      "annotations": {
        "summary": "Test alert summary",
        "description": "This is a test alert description"
      },
      "startsAt": "2025-12-19T22:00:00.000Z",
      "endsAt": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z",
      "generatorURL": "http://prometheus:9090/graph?g0.expr=up",
      "fingerprint": "abc123"
    }
  ],
  "groupLabels": {
    "alertname": "TestAlert"
  },
  "commonLabels": {
    "alertname": "TestAlert",
    "severity": "warning"
  },
  "commonAnnotations": {
    "summary": "Test alert summary"
  },
  "externalURL": "http://alertmanager:9093",
  "version": "4",
  "groupKey": "{}/{severity=\"warning\"}:{alertname=\"TestAlert\"}"
}'
```

This matches the exact structure that Alertmanager sends, which the ntfy built-in `alertmanager` template is designed to parse.

curl -vX POST "http://10.100.5.100:8080/homelab-alerts?template=alertmanager&priority=default&tags=warning,homelab" -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"receiver":"ntfy","status":"firing","alerts":[{"status":"firing","labels":{"alertname":"TestAlert","severity":"warning","instance":"test-server:9100"},"annotations":{"summary":"Test alert summary","description":"This is a test alert description"},"startsAt":"2025-12-19T22:00:00.000Z","endsAt":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","generatorURL":"http://prometheus:9090/graph?g0.expr=up","fingerprint":"abc123"}],"groupLabels":{"alertname":"TestAlert"},"commonLabels":{"alertname":"TestAlert","severity":"warning"},"commonAnnotations":{"summary":"Test alert summary"},"externalURL":"http://alertmanager:9093","version":"4","groupKey":"{}/{severity=\"warning\"}:{alertname=\"TestAlert\"}"}'

